---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms of sale" description="Terms of sale for Energy Peptides.">
  <section class="section container legal-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Policy</p>
    <h1 class="t-section">Terms of sale</h1>
    <div class="prose measure">
<p>These terms apply to every order placed with Energy Wellness Club LLC, trading as Energy Peptides. Placing an order means you accept them.</p>
<h2>Products</h2>
<p>All products are supplied for laboratory research use only, under our <a href="/legal/research-use-only/">research use policy</a>. Descriptions and specifications are provided for research purposes; certificates of analysis are available on request.</p>
<h2>Orders and payment</h2>
<p>Prices are in US dollars per vial. An order is accepted when payment is confirmed. We may cancel and refund any order at our discretion, including where the purchaser attestation appears not to be met.</p>
<h2>Shipping</h2>
<p>We ship within the United States only. Shipping charges and timing are described on the <a href="/legal/shipping-returns/">shipping and returns</a> page.</p>
<h2>Returns</h2>
<p>Because products are temperature-sensitive research materials, we do not accept returns of opened or shipped product. Damaged or incorrect shipments are replaced or refunded when reported within 7 days of delivery.</p>
<h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
<p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Energy Wellness Club LLC is not liable for any use of the products other than laboratory research by qualified persons.</p>
<p class="muted">Placeholder terms drafted 2026-09-09. Review with counsel before going live.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .legal-page { max-width: var(--measure); display: grid; gap: var(--s5); }
  .prose h2 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: var(--s5); }
  .prose p, .prose li { color: var(--text-dim); margin-top: var(--s2); }
  .prose ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .prose .muted { color: var(--text-faint); font-size: 14px; }
</style>
